    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφορος</span></b> , ὁ, (cf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίουρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overseer, guardian, ruler</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					145
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαγίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					265c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπῶν, οἰάκων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				41
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				42
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς γενέσεως ἔ. θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Ti.</u>
					1.53
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, al.: as fem., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				160
			</span></i>: later in neut. pl., 
